<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong gold closed for Christmas holidays.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong gold closed for Christmas holidays.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong gold markets will be closed on December 25 and December 26 for Christmas.</p>
<p>Gold markets will reopen on Friday, December 27.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6441</p>
</text>
